  "Line": {
    "DefaultText": "She comes closer. Still holding her gaze.\r\n\n\" Mine own man\" she says. \r\n\r\nHer light seems fainter now.\r\n\r\nThe pain deepens.",
    "Text": "她举步向你。目光交织。\\n\\n",
    "zh": "她举步向你。目光交织。\\n\\n",
    "en": "She comes closer. Still holding her gaze.\\n\\n\" Mine own man\" she says. \\n\\nHer light seems fainter now.\\n\\nThe pain deepens.",
    "ja": "彼女は視線を重ねたまま、ゆっくりと近づいてくる。\\n\\n「我が愛しき人」\\n彼女はそう囁く。\\n\\nその光は、先ほどよりも淡く見えた。\\n\\n胸の痛みがさらに深まっていく。"
  },
